[h1]Commander Event Expansion[/h1]

A brand-new system will become available tomorrow, launching alongside the upcoming Commander event. Today, we're diving into all the details of what awaits you! With the introduction of Ranks and Neural Links, you have the opportunity to customize your playstyle in detail and create the perfect Commander that matches your preferences.

Let's take a closer look at the new stuff:
• Commander Ranks - a paralel progression that lets you add some extra health for your Commander;
• Enhanced Commander's Path Event - this new event will allow you to acquire new resources to upgrade your Commanders;
• Commander Neural Links - link up you commanders to get more extra health and access to Alternative abilities;
• Alternative abilities - mix up and change your commander skills to make them more effective and fitting your personal strategy.

Read the complete guide to the new Commander system [url=https://support.lustgoddess.com/hc/en-us/articles/27793985768082-Commanders-2-0]here[/url] and update your game so you won't miss the new features!

